<h2>September 21, 2026 - Debugging Project: Space Station</h2>

<h3>Project Description</h3>

<p>
    In this project, I worked on a Java program that originally contained
    32 errors. The goal was to identify and fix different types of errors
    related to variables, data types, printing, casting, mathematical
    operations, overflow, and methods from the Math class.
</p>

<h3>Java Code</h3>

<pre>
