<h3>Topics Practiced</h3>

<p>
    In this project, I practiced debugging Java code involving variable
    declarations, data types, casting, integer and double division, the
    modulo operator, increment operators, overflow, and methods such as
    Math.abs(), Math.sqrt(), Math.pow(), and Math.random().
</p>

<h3>What I Learned</h3>

<p>
    I learned that small syntax and logic mistakes can cause a program to
    behave incorrectly or not compile at all. I also became more familiar
    with reading compiler errors and checking Java code line by line to
    find problems.
</p>
